  "title": "Before & After | {{brand}} Treatment Results",
  "description": "See before and after photos from {{brand}}, including Botox, lip filler, treatment under the eyes and dental veneers. Results vary by person.",
  "h1": "See the results.",
  "updated": "2026-11-24",
  "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"page-hero__art\" data-bg=\"before-after\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <picture>\n          <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/images/bg/before-after-960.avif 960w, /assets/images/bg/before-after-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 90vw, 40vw\"></source>\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/images/bg/before-after-960.webp 960w, /assets/images/bg/before-after-1920.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 90vw, 40vw\"></source>\n          <img class=\"hero-bg__media\" src=\"/assets/images/bg/before-after-1920.jpg\" srcset=\"/assets/images/bg/before-after-960.jpg 960w, /assets/images/bg/before-after-1920.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 90vw, 40vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\">\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" data-reveal><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <span class=\"crumbs__sep\">·</span> <span>Before &amp; After</span></nav>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-reveal style=\"margin-top:1.6rem\"><span class=\"eyebrow__dot\"></span> Real results</p>\n        <h1 class=\"page-hero__title\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"1\">See the<br> <em>results.</em></h1>\n        <p class=\"page-hero__lede\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"2\">These photos show treatment results from {{brand}}. Choose a treatment to filter the photos, then tap an image for a closer look.</p>\n        <svg class=\"page-hero__thread\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"3\">\n          <path d=\"M4 12 C 120 -4, 300 22, 416 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#lgph)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n          <defs><linearGradient id=\"lgph\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\">\n            <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8C8C8C\"></stop><stop offset=\"0.5\" stop-color=\"#545454\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#333333\"></stop>\n          </linearGradient></defs>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section gallery\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"cmp-feature\" data-reveal>\n          <div class=\"cmp\" id=\"cmpUndereye\">\n            <img class=\"cmp__after\" src=\"/assets/images/ba-slider-after.jpg\" alt=\"After Botox at {{brand}}, a smooth, relaxed forehead\" width=\"1400\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            <img class=\"cmp__before\" src=\"/assets/images/ba-slider-before.jpg\" alt=\"Before Botox, deep horizontal forehead lines\" width=\"1400\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            <span class=\"cmp__tag cmp__tag--before\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Before</span>\n            <span class=\"cmp__tag cmp__tag--after\" aria-hidden=\"true\">After</span>\n            <input type=\"range\" class=\"cmp__range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" step=\"0.5\" aria-label=\"Drag to compare before and after\">\n            <div class=\"cmp__divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n            <div class=\"cmp__grip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 7l-5 5 5 5M16 7l5 5-5 5\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cmp-feature__cap\">\n            <span class=\"cap-name\">Botox</span>\n            <span class=\"cap-meta\">Forehead lines, softened</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"cmp-feature__hint\">Drag the gold handle to compare</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"filters\" data-reveal role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter results\">\n          <button class=\"filter is-active\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button>\n          <button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"dental\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Dental</button>\n          <button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"lips\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Lips</button>\n          <button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"eyes\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Under the eyes</button>\n          <button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"botox\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Botox</button>\n          <button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"contour\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Contour</button>\n          <button class=\"filter\" data-filter=\"skinhair\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Skin &amp; Hair</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"gallery__grid\" id=\"galleryGrid\">\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"dental\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-dental-veneers.jpg\" alt=\"Dental veneers before and after result at {{brand}}, discoloured crowded teeth to a bright even smile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1446\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-dental-veneers-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-dental-veneers-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-dental-veneers.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Hollywood Smile</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"dental\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-dental-smile.jpg\" alt=\"Veneers smile result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1467\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-dental-smile-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-dental-smile-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-dental-smile.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Result</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Veneers</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"botox\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-botox-forehead.jpg\" alt=\"Botox before and after result at {{brand}}, deep forehead lines smoothed\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1466\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-botox-forehead-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-botox-forehead-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-botox-forehead.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Botox</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"lips\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler.jpg\" alt=\"Lip Filler before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1358\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Lip Filler</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"botox\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-botox.jpg\" alt=\"Botox before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1453\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-botox-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-botox-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-botox.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Botox</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"contour\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-nose-filler.jpg\" alt=\"Nose Filler before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1449\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-nose-filler-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-nose-filler-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-nose-filler.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Nose Filler</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"contour\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-jawline-filler.jpg\" alt=\"Jawline Filler before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1443\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-jawline-filler-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-jawline-filler-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-jawline-filler.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Jawline Filler</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"lips\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-2.jpg\" alt=\"Lip Filler before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1437\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-2-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-2-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-2.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Lip Filler</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"contour\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-nasolabial-folds.jpg\" alt=\"Nasolabial Folds before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1447\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-nasolabial-folds-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-nasolabial-folds-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-nasolabial-folds.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Nasolabial Folds</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"skinhair\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-hair-facial.jpg\" alt=\"Hair Facial before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1453\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-hair-facial-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-hair-facial-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-hair-facial.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Hair Facial</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"contour\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-jawline-enhancement.jpg\" alt=\"Jawline Enhancement before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1362\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-jawline-enhancement-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-jawline-enhancement-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-jawline-enhancement.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Jawline Enhancement</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"lips\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-3.jpg\" alt=\"Lip Filler before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1382\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-3-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-3-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-3.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Lip Filler</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"lips\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-4.jpg\" alt=\"Lip Filler before and after result at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1439\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-lip-filler-4-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-4-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-lip-filler-4.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Lip Filler</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"eyes\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-undereye-filler-2.jpg\" alt=\"Filler under the eyes before and after at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1332\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-undereye-filler-2-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-undereye-filler-2-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-undereye-filler-2.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Filler Under the Eyes</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n          <figure class=\"ba\" data-cat=\"eyes\">\n            <img src=\"/assets/images/ba-undereye-treatment.jpg\" alt=\"Treatment under the eyes before and after at {{brand}}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"880\" height=\"1274\" srcset=\"/assets/images/ba-undereye-treatment-320.jpg 320w, /assets/images/ba-undereye-treatment-560.jpg 560w, /assets/images/ba-undereye-treatment.jpg 880w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 32vw\">\n            <figcaption class=\"ba__cap\"><span class=\"ba__tag\">Before &amp; After</span><span class=\"ba__name\">Treatment Under the Eyes</span></figcaption>\n          </figure>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"section__sub\" style=\"text-align:center;max-width:620px;margin:3rem auto 0\" data-reveal>\n          These photos are shared with our clients' consent. Results vary from person to person. At your consultation, we will discuss what you can reasonably expect.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"cta-band__title\" data-reveal>Let's <em>talk</em> about your goals.</h2>\n        <p class=\"cta-band__sub\" data-reveal>Tell us what you would like to change. We will explain the options, likely results and recovery before you decide.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-band__actions\" data-reveal>\n          <a href=\"/book\" class=\"btn btn--gold btn--lg\">Book your appointment\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"btn__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>\n          </a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" data-open-booking href=\"/book\">Quick WhatsApp booking</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  ",
  "faqs": []
